    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5817" root="جش" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَشَّهُ</span></b> , (S, A, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَشُ3َ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَشٌّ</span>, (S,)
<i>He ground it</i> (namely wheat, S, or grain, A)
<i>coarsely;</i> (S, A;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجَشَّهُ</span></b> . (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He
bruised, brayed,</i> or <i>pounded, it:</i> and <i>he broke it:</i>
(S, K:) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجَشَّهُ</span></b> . (K) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He beat him,</i>
or <i>struck him,</i> with a staff or stick. (S, K.)

